  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-08-29T01:37:43.017Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When uploading a world, allow the creator to add a 360 panorama that would display instead of the default starfield in the loading screen. Would give you something to look around at when a world is loading, and would allow you to aquaint yourself with new worlds before you jump in. In other cases, the world maker could use it for other informative purposes, such as adding a level map in game worlds, or world info that it might be useful to know.",
